{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the world's end, the lone city breathes in silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this desolate metropolis, you have only three things: a loyal dog, a sleek sports car, and your solitary will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast, perilous post-apocalyptic city awaits your exploration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, cultivate crops, craft food and weapons to endure the wasteland.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shooting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience AAA-level first-person shooting with intense combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Car</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive and customize various sports cars with realistic physics and stunning skins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face dozens of unique mutated creatures, each with distinct abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and personalize your own shelter amidst the ruins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moral choices between good and evil lie hidden in the wasteland.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Note: The above are the contents of the full version of the game. Currently, there is not that much content in the game.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This game is still evolving. I'm building it from scratch with utmost dedication.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It's free to play. If you're interested, please add it to your wishlist and be part of its journey.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You can also take a look at another of our games, &quot;Rider Valkyries&quot;.</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3764180?t=1767901028","background_raw":"https://shared.akama